{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"477"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ、早く寝ないと東京ビッグサイトに行かなければ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←どこに行くでしょ〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何？東京ビッグサイトで何があったんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えて下さいっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"478"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季節で「春」が好きって書いてましたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「春」がなくなったらどうしますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日来ないから、一生15歳だ＼(∀)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それアリかもしれない♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやでもよく考えたら、お花見も、入学式卒業式も、ぐるカーの個別握手会もなくなるじゃん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何より春色のワンピース着れないじゃん(^^;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱナシかもしれない!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"479"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わさび味の柿ピーもあるけどひめたんは食べれるん？笑っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べたことないけど、美味しそーう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんわさびのチューブは食べきらんけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わさび味のお菓子は食べきるー(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい大分弁使ってみましたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"480"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、手紙書くとき気を付けてる事とかってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの手紙はいつも支離滅裂です(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも、読む人を幸せにさせる自信だけは底なしにある♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"481"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん当分はぱっつんで行くの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その予定であります(`・・)ゝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"482"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、オススメの温泉なんてある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉ねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが教えてほしいです。どこかオススメの温泉とかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにせいたん(畠中清羅chan)に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大分は温泉いいよーってすすめてもらったかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"483"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんブログだああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しみにしとったんよ？しってた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんまにー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らんかった(・∀・)!嬉しい!ありがとうですー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんがブログ書くの楽しみにしとったのは知っとったー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"484"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京の高校かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんぽーん♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋に説明会行ってからずっと憧れとった高校です(^^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"485"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新生活は東京だよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえすっ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"486"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校入ってなんかしたいことあるん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"487"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生になったらやりたい事とか目標とかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステキな女子高生なる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お勉強も出来て、可愛いくて、乃木坂でも活躍してる子になれるって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいいぢゃないですかー(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理想像であるメンバーには毎日会えちゃうから、頑張ろって思いますいつも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"488"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はね忘れない限りブログ開設から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日メンバー全員の記事にコメしてるんだけど...知ってた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん毎回コメントチェックしとるくらいよー∩^ω^∩♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"489"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはサッカーに興味あるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルールとかよくわからんけど、スポーツ見るのは好き(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"490"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの、お散歩って大体何分くらいするんですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４時間(・∀・)どや!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５回お風呂に入って４時間お散歩する15歳、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界に２人もいないと思いますよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"491"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここんとこ仕事忙しくて満足にコメ出来ないよ〜( ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短めでもいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくださるだけで嬉しいですー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短いコメントも嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいっ(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"492"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの好きな花はなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さくら(。・ω・。)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花はみんな好きだけど、さくらは本当に好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユリとかも好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばい!春なくなっちゃだめだよ春!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"493"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きで好きで好きすぎるんですけど（笑）、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと好きでいてもいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きですねー(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなひめきゅんのみなさんが、ひめたんも好きで好きで好きすぎるです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと好きでいてください!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"494"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうちょっとひき画像無いの？　家に飾りたいんだけど（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひき画...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯フォルダん中探せばあるかもだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしいからやめておきます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q4.尊敬する人は誰ー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん読みました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂とか、ひめたーんとか書いて下さった方、ありがとうございます///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほかにもふぁみりーさん、いろんなジャンルの方々挙げられてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しく読ませていただきまーしたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q5.何月生まれでーすか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４月多いねーひめたんと一緒じゃん(`・ω・')!!これからもいっぱいいっぱい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとうコメント書かせてくださいなー♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/04/0421665/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん(*´・ω・*)"}],"source":"archive"}